# This repository is public and is served as-is by GitHub Pages: anything
# committed here is downloadable by anyone who guesses the filename, whether or
# not the site links to it. A private course reading pack was committed by
# accident once and had to be taken back out, so source documents are kept out
# by default.
#
# The site itself needs no local PDF or Office file: works are cited by their
# original publication in SOURCES-AND-QUOTES.md, and the two PDFs referenced in
# timeline-data.json are links to archive.org and to SikhRI's own CDN.
#
# If you genuinely mean to publish one, override with:  git add -f <file>
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.epub
